message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "RingSentry"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Delun"
    family-names: "Gong"
    affiliation: "Institute of Metal Research, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Shenyang, People's Republic of China"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7877-7707"
