url: "https://github.com/D-sudoasd/ringsentry"
identifiers:
  - description: "Concept DOI for all archived versions of the software."
    type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.19602728"
abstract: >-
  RingSentry is desktop GUI software for reproducible preprocessing and quality
  control of 2D diffraction detector images, including SAXS, WAXS, SXRD, and
  GIWAXS workflows, with multi-format I/O, dark/flat correction, preview,
  geometry transforms, intensity processing, reports, and Q conversion tools.
version: "7.0.0"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - 2D diffraction
  - SAXS
  - WAXS
  - SXRD
  - GIWAXS
  - image preprocessing
  - diffraction detector
  - materials science
